OL,3,ASecondary schools told to stop teaching
OL,4,AGCSEs before Year 10
OL,5,
OL,6,FSecondary schools will be told not to
OL,7,Fteach GCSEs early as part of a major
OL,8,Fshake-up of how children in Years 7 to
OL,9,F9 are taught.
OL,11,FThe government plans to make Key Stage
OL,12,F3 a more distinct education phase,
OL,13,Furging schools to focus less on exams
OL,14,Fand more on a "richer, more engaging"
OL,15,Fexperience.
OL,17,FThe changes come in response to two
OL,18,Freviews that found pupils were
OL,19,Fincreasingly becoming disengaged in
OL,20,Ftheir early teenage years, affecting
OL,21,Fattendance and achievement, the
OL,22,FDepartment for Education (DfE) said.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
