OL,3,ASecondary schools told to stop teaching
OL,4,AGCSEs before Year 10
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe move will mark a reversal of the
OL,7,Fapproach taken by the previous
OL,8,FConservative government to focus the
OL,9,Ffirst three years of secondary school
OL,10,Fon core subjects and on doing well in
OL,11,Fassessments.
